<div className={styles.pvlRoot}>
	<!-- Overview -->
<section class="py-5 py-lg-6" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
<div class="container py-lg-4">
<div class="row justify-content-center">
<div class="col-lg-9">
<p class="section-kicker mb-2">The Challenge</p>
<h2 id="overview-heading" class="section-title display-5 mb-4">A National Challenge With Local Impact</h2>
<p class="fs-5">The National Commander’s Virtual Red Kettle Challenge invites Advisory Organization members, Salvation Army personnel, volunteers, and supporters to use their networks to help raise funds for their local Salvation Army.</p>
<p>Virtual Red Kettles are organized locally, so participation may look different from one community to another. Contact your local Salvation Army to learn how its Virtual Red Kettle campaign is set up and how you can create, sponsor, support, or share a kettle.</p>
<p class="mb-0"><strong>Every gift helps support the work of The Salvation Army in the community connected to that Virtual Red Kettle.</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- How to Participate -->
<section class="bg-light py-5" aria-labelledby="participate-heading">
<div class="container py-lg-4">
<div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 760px;">
<p class="section-kicker mb-2">Get Involved</p>
<h2 id="participate-heading" class="section-title display-5">How to Participate</h2>
</div>
<div class="row g-4">
<div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
<article class="card step-card">
<div class="card-body p-4"><span class="step-number mb-3" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
<h3 class="h4 fw-bold">Connect locally</h3>
<p class="mb-0">Use the location finder to contact your local Salvation Army corps, division, or fundraising representative. Ask how you can participate in its 2026 Virtual Red Kettle campaign.</p>
</div>
</article>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
<article class="card step-card">
<div class="card-body p-4"><span class="step-number mb-3" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
<h3 class="h4 fw-bold">Get your Virtual Red Kettle link</h3>
<p class="mb-0">Your local Salvation Army can help you identify the appropriate Virtual Red Kettle or peer-to-peer fundraising option for your community.</p>
</div>
</article>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
<article class="card step-card">
<div class="card-body p-4"><span class="step-number mb-3" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
<h3 class="h4 fw-bold">Share the challenge</h3>
<p class="mb-0">Invite friends, family, colleagues, and community contacts to give. Share why supporting your local Salvation Army matters to you and encourage others to pass the invitation along.</p>
</div>
</article>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
<article class="card step-card">
<div class="card-body p-4"><span class="step-number mb-3" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
<h3 class="h4 fw-bold">Help your community</h3>
<p class="mb-0">Funds raised through local Virtual Red Kettles help support Salvation Army programs and services in the communities they serve.</p>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
<div class="text-center mt-5"><a class="btn btn-tsa btn-lg px-4" href="/freestyle/REPLACE-WITH-LOCATION-FINDER-URL">Find Your Local Salvation Army</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- AO Members -->
<section class="py-5" aria-labelledby="ao-heading">
<div class="container py-lg-4">
<div class="audience-panel rounded-3 p-4 p-lg-5">
<div class="row align-items-center g-4">
<div class="col-lg-8">
<p class="section-kicker mb-2">Advisory Organizations</p>
<h2 id="ao-heading" class="section-title mb-3">A Special Invitation to Advisory Organization Members</h2>
<p class="fs-5">Your leadership and connections can introduce more people to The Salvation Army’s mission and expand support for work happening in your community.</p>
<p class="mb-0">Partner with your local Salvation Army to sponsor or support a Virtual Red Kettle, then invite your personal and professional networks to join you. A simple message, shared with the people who know and trust you, can help make a meaningful local difference this Christmas season.</p>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end"><a class="btn btn-tsa btn-lg" href="/freestyle/REPLACE-WITH-LOCATION-FINDER-URL">Connect With Your Local Salvation Army</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- National Commander -->
<section class="py-5 bg-light" aria-labelledby="commander-heading">
<div class="container py-lg-4">
<div class="row align-items-center g-5">
<div class="col-lg-6">
<p class="section-kicker mb-2">Join the Challenge</p>
<h2 id="commander-heading" class="section-title display-6 mb-4">Join the National Commander</h2>
<p class="fs-5">The National Commander is participating with a Virtual Red Kettle and inviting others across the country to join the challenge. If you are not connected with a local Virtual Red Kettle, you may support the National Commander’s kettle directly.</p>
<a class="btn btn-tsa btn-lg mt-2" href="/freestyle/REPLACE-WITH-NC-KETTLE-URL">Support the National Commander’s Virtual Red Kettle</a></div>
<div class="col-lg-6" aria-labelledby="video-heading">
<h3 id="video-heading" class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">A Message From the National Commander</h3>
<p>Hear the National Commander’s invitation to join the 2026 Virtual Red Kettle Challenge and help build support for The Salvation Army’s work in communities across the country.</p>
<!-- Replace this placeholder with your responsive video iframe. -->
<div class="video-placeholder p-4">
<div>
<div class="display-6 mb-2" aria-hidden="true">▶</div>
<strong>National Commander video embed</strong>
<div class="small text-white-50 mt-1">Replace this block with the approved video player.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Closing CTA -->
<section class="closing-cta py-5" aria-labelledby="closing-heading">
<div class="container py-lg-4 text-center">
<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 850px;">
<h2 id="closing-heading" class="section-title display-5 mb-3">Your Network Can Help Your Community</h2>
<p class="lead mb-4">Connect with your local Salvation Army, find the right Virtual Red Kettle opportunity, and invite others to join you in making a difference this Christmas season.</p>
<div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-center gap-3"><a class="btn btn-tsa btn-lg px-4" href="/freestyle/REPLACE-WITH-LOCATION-FINDER-URL">Find Your Local Salvation Army</a> <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-4" href="/freestyle/REPLACE-WITH-NC-KETTLE-URL">Support the National Commander’s Virtual Red Kettle</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
